<mxCell id="note" value="Report EMPTY_POSITION and save the failing n. Do not divide by zero, output zeros, or emit partial logits.&lt;br&gt;Do not erase memory: clear its frame-valid flag. After error acceptance the next frame may start without hard reset.&lt;br&gt;Other hardware/protocol errors still follow the fatal stop/drain/report/reset policy.&lt;br&gt;A Read / Write state uses the shared transaction FSM. A Run state waits for child completion. Stalls never advance an index." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=16;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#374151;fontColor=#374151;strokeWidth=2;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#263442;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="615" width="1440" height="85" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
